description:
South Holland District Council (&quot;the Council&quot;) is seeking to procure the services of a BAFE Fire Safety Register Registered, SIA Approved Contractor or NSI approved Contractor(s) to undertake the following services;
      
      Lot 1 - The monitoring of fire safety systems, Intruder alarms and CCTV systems.
      Lot 2 - The service, maintenance and testing of fire safety systems, Intruder alarms and CCTV systems
